    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good starting point for the contrast. I want to lean hard into that \"visible desperation\" thing for the street crews though. \n\nCan you flesh out a couple of specific characters from those minority/immigrant neighborhoods? I'm looking for some descriptions that really capture that grit—maybe a couple of guys who are the face of the local street violence or the ones actually moving the product on the corners. I want to make sure the audience immediately gets that these are the \"rough\" parts of town just by looking at them. What's their vibe, what are they wearing, and how do they interact with the locals?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
