      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Consider \"Sal,\" a wiry mover who walks with the permanent hunch of someone who expects a blow, favoring heavy, faded tracksuits that look secondhand but are perpetually clean. He interacts with locals with practiced, wary nods, never stopping for small talk unless it serves him. Then there's \"Boom,\" a larger presence who wears oversized, utilitarian work boots and a jacket riddled with patch jobs; his silence is more intimidating than any shouting, and he patrols the corners not for sales, but to establish presence through sheer, heavy inertia.",
